text:
it's an MCP for Claude that takes (endpoint, api, newsletter-like Substack) and creates content for LinkedIn, X, Bluesky (beta), Threads(beta), and IG. Why this is helping us post more:

We handle the "connecting part" - so every person doesn't need to manage their own OAuth with fuckedup APIs from Meta or X;

Generates assets for posts (no need to go to Canva or what ever); Ai-generations are good enough now.

Cron is supported, so you can always post on schedule;

We have analytics inside - so you can just simply check stats every day with a prompt;

For 30 people, we are releasing it for free for three months; 100 generations are free with nanobanana pro.

Location: Tbilisi, Georgia;
  Remote: Yes;
  Willing to relocate: It depends;
  Technologies: HTML; CSS; Sass; JavaScript; React.js; jQuery; TypeScript; GraphQL, Apollo Client, React Query; Bulma, Tailwind CSS, Styled Components; Figma, Canva; Git, GitHub, Gitlab;
  Résumé/CV: https://peachfolio.online/src/res/p6each_resume.pdf
  Email: p6eac.h@gmail.com


Hello. I am a Front-End Web Developer from Tbilisi/Georgia, currently working remotely for VideowindoW, a Dutch startup, while pursuing a Bachelor's degree in Software Engineering at AmsterdamTech.

With over 2 years of experience in web app development and more than a year of practical experience at VideowindoW, I am seeking new opportunities. My current role has transitioned to mainly maintenance work, so I am looking for a new challenge, whether full-time or part-time. I am based in the EU but can adapt to different time zones.

I enjoy working in tech and would love to contribute to exciting projects. If you are looking for someone with my skills and experience, I would love to connect.

You can view my work on GitHub: https://github.com/peac-h
And explore my portfolio at: https://peachfolio.online/
